sequenceDiagram
    participant Pipe as Compute pipeline
    participant TEE as Teecryptor
    participant CR as CommitmentRegistry

    Pipe->>Pipe: store the ciphertext under the handle
    Pipe->>CR: postCommitments (batched)
    Note over Pipe,CR: later, when someone asks to decrypt that handle
    TEE->>CR: getCommitment(version, handle)
    CR-->>TEE: expected hash
    TEE->>TEE: fetch the ciphertext from CT Server
    TEE->>TEE: check the bytes hash to the commitment
